        },
        {
          "text": "Ngesikhatshana nje yonke inotho yakho ichithekile. Lezinduna zemikolo, labo bonke abahamba olwandle, labatshayeli bonke bemikolo abamisebenzi yabo isolwandle, bema khatshana,",
